Status Trio Fan (fork)
Copyright 2026 yuting-ou

This fork adds a fan-status section to the status popover, bridged to the
separately installed FanCtl (清风) root daemon via its file-based contract
(/Library/Application Support/FanCtl/{status.json,config.json}); it contains
no fan-control algorithm of its own. It also adds an alternate Sparkle feed
and signing key, a MOBILE_BATTERY build flag, and an upstream-sync workflow.

Modified files (Apache-2.0 §4(b) notice): see git history on branch
"fan-section" at https://github.com/yuting-ou/status-trio — every file this
fork changed carries a "Modified by the Status Trio Fan fork" header comment.
Upstream source: https://github.com/lingyired/status-trio (Apache-2.0).
